python-wb-sdk-pro (2.2.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Release v2.2.0: Full compatibility with Python 3.8-3.16, PyPy 3.8-3.12,
    and Free-Threaded No-GIL (3.13t-3.16t) builds.
  * Pure-Python thread-safe model layer and transport fallbacks (zero C/Rust
    build dependencies required for core SDK, CLI, and MCP Server).
  * Add Debian/Ubuntu APT & PPA packaging (python3-wb-sdk-pro) and multi-runtime CI.

